body='<p class="eyebrow">REPAIR KITS, CONTROLLERS & HARDWARE</p><h1>Keep playing.<br>Choose the right fix.</h1><p class="lead">Start with your test results and warranty. Then compare compatible parts or a replacement on Amazon.</p><p class="affiliate-notice" data-affiliate-disclosure>Amazon shopping links are not yet monetized. No commission is currently earned.</p><section><h2>Check before you buy</h2><p>A high reading does not automatically mean you need a new controller. Repeat the test, check firmware and game settings, and review your manufacturer’s warranty. Kits and parts vary by model and revision. StickCheck does not independently test or certify the products in these search results.</p></section><section><h2>Shop by what you need</h2><p>These links open Amazon.com search results, not a claim that a particular listing is compatible or recommended. Compare seller information, specifications, return terms, and current availability on Amazon.</p><div class="card-grid">'
