body+='</div></section><aside class="ad-placement" data-ad-position="shopping" aria-label="Advertisement"><span>ADVERTISEMENT</span><div class="ad-mount"></div></aside><section><h2>Make a replacement your last guess.</h2><p>Save a before-repair baseline, then retest after any repair or hardware change. A kit purchase is not proof that a repair will solve your issue.</p><a class="button primary" href="/">Back to controller diagnostics →</a></section>'
